	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 3rd level, you become known for your loyalty, largesse, and honorable nature. When interacting with law abiding citizens, guards, and soldiers, you gain an expertise die on any Deception or Persuasion check. Amongst criminals you gain disadvantage on those same checks but expertise on Intimidation checks. Finally, you gain proficiency in Persuasion.</p>",
